@startuml
title AgriMart Project Workflow

skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Calibri
skinparam defaultFontSize 16
skinparam ArrowColor #1F4E79
skinparam activity {
  BackgroundColor #EAF4EA
  BorderColor #2E7D32
  FontColor #17324D
  DiamondBackgroundColor #FFF3D6
  DiamondBorderColor #C98516
}

start
:Identify the market-access and\nprice-information problem;
:Review agricultural marketplaces\nand forecasting studies;
:Define requirements, users,\nscope and system architecture;

fork
  :Develop mobile application;
fork again
  :Develop web application\nand Express API;
fork again
  :Prepare historical price data;
  :Engineer features and\ntrain the XGBoost model;
  :Expose forecasts through\nthe FastAPI service;
end fork

:Integrate mobile, web, Express,\nFastAPI and Supabase components;
:Run functional, API and\nforecasting tests;

while (Requirements met?) is (No)
  :Fix defects and refine\nthe affected component;
  :Repeat integration and testing;
endwhile (Yes)

:Evaluate results and\ndocument limitations;
:Deploy and demonstrate\nthe completed AgriMart system;
stop
@enduml
